   "n": 17,
   "title": "Scientific Theories",
   "items": [
    {
     "t": "text",
     "box": [
      36.438,
      6.889,
      43.812,
      12.333
     ],
     "anchor": "m",
     "slot": 1,
     "p": [
      {
       "al": "l",
       "lh": 1.0,
       "r": [
        {
         "x": "Greek philosophers proposed that objects fall because they seek their natural places. The more massive the object, the faster it falls.",
         "sz": 15.0,
         "c": "#3D3D3D",
         "f": "Patrick Hand"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "text",
     "box": [
      36.438,
      31.111,
      43.812,
      11.667
     ],
     "anchor": "m",
     "slot": 2,
     "p": [
      {
       "al": "l",
       "lh": 1.0,
       "r": [
        {
         "x": "Galileo showed that the speed at which an object falls depends on the amount of time for which that object has fallen and not on the object's mass.",
         "sz": 15.0,
         "c": "#3D3D3D",
         "f": "Patrick Hand"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "text",
     "box": [
      36.438,
      54.556,
      43.812,
      11.667
     ],
     "anchor": "m",
     "slot": 3,
     "p": [
      {
       "al": "l",
       "lh": 1.0,
       "r": [
        {
         "x": "Newton provided an explanation for why objects fall. Newton proposed that objects fall because the object and Earth are attracted by a force. Newton also stated that there is a force of attraction between any two objects with mass.",
         "sz": 15.0,
         "c": "#3D3D3D",
         "f": "Patrick Hand"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "text",
     "box": [
      36.438,
      78.0,
      43.812,
      12.0
     ],
     "anchor": "m",
     "slot": 4,
     "p": [
      {
       "al": "l",
       "lh": 1.0,
       "r": [
        {
         "x": "Einstein suggested that the force of attraction between two objects is due to mass causing the space around it to curve.",
         "sz": 15.0,
         "c": "#3D3D3D",
         "f": "Patrick Hand"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
